aws-c-sdkutils
------------------------------------------
C99 library implementing AWS SDK specific utilities

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libaws-c-common1.0-1.0.5-1bl1
  libaws-c-sdkutils-devel-1.0.1-1bl1
  libaws-c-sdkutils1.0-1.0.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libaws-c-common-devel-1.0.5-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/awslabs/aws-c-sdkutils

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/awslabs/aws-c-sdkutils/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack aws-c-sdkutils-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./aws-c-sdkutils-1.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/aws-c-sdkutils-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/aws-c-sdkutils-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libaws-c-sdkutils1.0-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libaws-c-sdkutils-devel-1.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(aws-c-sdkutils)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/aws-c-sdkutils.README
